alue but never used.","Identifier","unusedVar","'user' is assigned a value but never used.","'handleProtectedLink' is assigned a value but never used.","'navigate' is assigned a value but never used.","jsx-a11y/anchor-is-valid","The href attribute requires a valid value to be accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide a valid href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","JSXOpeningElement","'cursoId' is assigned a value but never used.","react-hooks/exhaustive-deps","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'fetchData'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.","ArrayExpression",["266"],"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'fetchAluno' and 'fetchCursosAluno'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["267"],"React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'fetchAvaliacoes'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["268"],"React Hook useEffect has missing dependencies: 'fetchCursos' and 'fetchProfessor'. Either include them or remove the dependency array.",["269"],"eqeqeq","Expected '===' and instead saw '=='.","BinaryExpression","unexpected","'resposta' is assigned a value but never used.","'axios' is defined but never used.","'live' is defined but never used.","'alunos' is assigned a value but never used.","The href attribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide an href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","React Hook useEffect has a missing dependency: 'fetchCursosAluno'. Either include it or remove the dependency array.",["270"],"React Hook useEffect ha